{"id":"reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs","date":"2026-11-08","topic":"apps","region":"americas","headline":"Atari Paid Steve Jobs Extra Money for Game Design","source":{"name":"Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Breakout_(video_game)"},"accent":"us","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"Long ago, Steve Jobs wanted to make a new game.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t1-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.97,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":5.41,"times":[0.0,0.32,1.1,1.36,1.76,2.2,2.5,2.72,2.98,3.24]},{"text":"He asked his good friend Steve Wozniak to help.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","C","C"],"dur":3.08,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":4.5,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.28,0.54,0.74,1.08,1.6,2.32,2.56]},{"text":"Wozniak made the game design in only four days.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t1-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.84,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":4.57,"times":[0.0,0.62,0.94,1.16,1.38,1.68,2.08,2.5,2.92]},{"text":"The company gave Jobs a lot of money for this.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","M","M"],"dur":2.78,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":4.5,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.36,0.7,1.06,1.34,1.66,1.84,2.06,2.34]},{"text":"Jobs gave Wozniak only a small part of it.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.7,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":4.7,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.54,1.26,1.72,2.1,2.42,2.8,2.94]}],"bands":{"core1000":95,"core1800":0,"ngsl":0,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":5},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"asked his good friend Steve Wozniak to help.","title":"Verb + Object + To-Infinitive","note":"When you ask someone to perform an action, use 'ask + person + to + verb'. Here, Jobs is asking Wozniak to assist him."},{"i":3,"focus":"gave Jobs a lot of money","title":"Double Object Construction","note":"Some verbs like 'give' can take two objects: the receiver first and the thing given second. Here, 'Jobs' receives 'a lot of money'."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"In 1976, game maker Atari asked Steve Jobs to build Breakout.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t2-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","C","C","C"],"dur":5.79,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":7.47,"times":[0.0,0.18,1.78,1.98,2.42,2.66,3.52,4.0,4.22,4.7,4.92]},{"text":"The company promised extra money if Jobs used fewer parts.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","M","S","V","O","O"],"dur":3.64,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":5.14,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.32,0.72,1.14,1.5,1.8,2.0,2.34,2.72]},{"text":"Jobs asked Steve Wozniak for help because Wozniak was very fast.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","S","V","C","C"],"dur":4.45,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":4.73,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.56,1.02,1.64,1.82,2.06,2.56,3.14,3.3,3.66]},{"text":"Wozniak finished the work in four days and saved many parts.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t2-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","V","O","O"],"dur":3.95,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":4.32,"times":[0.0,0.48,0.72,0.98,1.16,1.42,1.76,2.18,2.6,2.8,3.18]},{"text":"Atari paid a big bonus, but Jobs shared only a little.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","S","V","O","O","O"],"dur":4.24,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":5.94,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.6,0.74,1.02,2.02,2.18,2.42,3.0,3.48,3.68]},{"text":"People will always remember this secret story between the two friends.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t2-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.34,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":5.9,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.4,0.88,1.34,1.66,2.08,2.6,3.0,3.2,3.36]}],"bands":{"core1000":85,"core1800":4,"ngsl":2,"tsl":2,"nawl":0,"beyond":7},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"if Jobs used fewer parts.","title":"Adverbial Condition Clause with If","note":"The word 'if' introduces a condition that explains when the extra money would be earned. Notice the past tense verb 'used' matches the past tense context of the sentence."},{"i":4,"focus":"Atari paid a big bonus, but Jobs shared only a little.","title":"Coordinating Conjunction But","note":"The word 'but' connects two independent clauses that show contrast. It highlights the difference between Atari paying generously and Jobs sharing greedily."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"In 1976, game company Atari hired Steve Jobs to design an arcade game.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t3-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.41,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":7.73,"times":[0.0,0.2,1.82,2.1,2.58,2.92,3.78,4.16,4.56,4.94,5.18,5.42,5.72]},{"text":"Atari offered a bonus for using fewer chips, which are small computer components.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","S","V","C","C","C"],"dur":5.02,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":7.7,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.72,0.86,1.22,1.58,1.84,2.24,3.24,3.32,3.46,3.7,4.16]},{"text":"Jobs asked his talented friend Steve Wozniak to help him with the design.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t3-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":4.3,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":6.22,"times":[0.0,0.16,0.52,0.82,1.14,1.64,2.1,2.88,3.1,3.26,3.44,3.56,3.66]},{"text":"Wozniak worked very fast and completed the entire project in just four days.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t3-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","M","M","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.45,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":6.03,"times":[0.0,0.52,0.76,1.18,1.66,2.02,2.42,2.68,2.94,3.68,4.02,4.18,4.54]},{"text":"Atari was impressed by the savings and paid a bonus worth several thousand dollars.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t3-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","M","M","M","M","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.99,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":5.84,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.5,0.86,1.34,1.46,1.76,2.18,2.38,2.5,2.8,3.04,3.46,4.06]},{"text":"However, Jobs told Wozniak that the reward was smaller and split that lesser amount.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t3-5.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","O","M","S","S","V","C","M","V","O","O","O"],"dur":5.65,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":7.57,"times":[0.0,0.9,1.06,1.48,2.18,2.4,2.48,2.74,3.02,3.48,3.96,4.34,4.68,4.92]},{"text":"Apple fans have often discussed this famous story about the early days of tech.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t3-6.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","V","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.63,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t3-6.m4a","durJa":5.91,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.46,0.68,1.02,1.44,1.76,2.06,2.52,2.84,2.98,3.24,3.56,3.76]}],"bands":{"core1000":77,"core1800":8,"ngsl":3,"tsl":5,"nawl":0,"beyond":7},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":", which are small computer components.","title":"Non-Defining Relative Clause","note":"A non-defining relative clause starts with a comma and 'which' to add extra, non-essential details. Here, it briefly defines what 'chips' are."},{"i":6,"focus":"have often discussed","title":"Present Perfect Tense","note":"The present perfect 'have discussed' connects past events to present interest. Adding 'often' inside the verb phrase shows frequency up until now."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"In 1976, video game pioneer Atari asked Steve Jobs to create a prototype, or early test version.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t4-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","C","C","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":8.59,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":10.52,"times":[0.0,0.22,1.86,2.24,2.56,2.92,3.62,4.28,4.78,5.16,5.46,5.7,5.98,7.06,7.16,7.56,7.84]},{"text":"Jobs was promised a substantial cash bonus for every hardware chip he managed to eliminate.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t4-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","S","V","C","C"],"dur":5.95,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":6.78,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.54,0.92,1.22,1.66,2.24,2.62,3.04,3.38,3.82,4.3,4.54,4.88,5.18]},{"text":"Realizing his own technical limits, Jobs recruited his skilled friend Steve Wozniak to assist him.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t4-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","C","C","C"],"dur":6.58,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":8.07,"times":[0.0,0.5,0.82,1.14,1.48,2.5,2.78,3.2,3.64,3.94,4.4,4.92,5.68,5.88,6.1]},{"text":"Wozniak worked continuously for four days and successfully built a remarkably efficient game board.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t4-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.64,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":7.31,"times":[0.0,0.54,0.78,1.42,2.06,2.34,2.76,3.36,3.74,4.38,4.5,4.92,5.72,6.06]},{"text":"Consequently, Atari rewarded Jobs with a massive bonus totaling several thousand dollars for the design.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t4-4.m4a","roles":["M","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.59,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":6.78,"times":[0.0,1.04,1.2,1.66,2.34,2.64,2.76,3.14,3.68,4.02,4.6,5.14,5.72,5.98,6.08]},{"text":"Wozniak was informed by Jobs that the payout was much smaller than Atari actually paid.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t4-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","M","M","M","S","S","V","C","C","M","S","M","V"],"dur":5.25,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":7.26,"times":[0.0,0.56,0.72,1.02,1.3,1.6,2.04,2.14,2.42,2.7,3.06,3.54,3.84,4.0,4.66]},{"text":"Jobs quietly kept the difference, handing his partner only half of the smaller reported figure.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t4-6.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.06,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":7.45,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.78,1.26,1.5,2.4,2.44,2.7,2.96,3.4,3.82,4.08,4.2,4.54,4.88]}],"bands":{"core1000":71,"core1800":6,"ngsl":12,"tsl":3,"nawl":0,"beyond":8},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":"Realizing his own technical limits,","title":"Participial Phrase as Modifier","note":"An -ing phrase at the start of a sentence functions like an adverbial clause showing cause or background. Here, it explains why Jobs decided to recruit Wozniak."},{"i":5,"focus":"was informed by Jobs that","title":"Passive Voice with Noun Clause","note":"'Was informed' shifts the focus to Wozniak as the receiver of information. The following 'that' clause details the misleading statement given to him."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"Before founding Apple together, Steve Jobs accepted an assignment from Atari to build a prototype for the arcade game Breakout.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.93,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":9.48,"times":[0.0,0.4,0.88,1.22,2.1,2.34,2.72,3.2,3.5,3.82,4.24,4.58,5.06,5.22,5.38,5.84,6.2,6.3,6.52,7.02]},{"text":"Seeking to reduce production expenses, Atari offered a lucrative bonus for every digital logic chip removed from the circuit board.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t5-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.81,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":8.65,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.42,0.66,1.0,2.3,2.36,3.02,3.2,3.52,4.04,4.4,4.8,5.26,5.66,6.06,6.38,6.94,7.04,7.24]},{"text":"Lacking the requisite engineering skills, Jobs enlisted his brilliant friend Steve Wozniak, promising to split the overall earnings evenly.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t5-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.53,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":10.52,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.48,0.8,1.24,2.4,2.5,2.86,3.34,3.74,4.22,4.74,5.82,6.2,6.5,6.76,6.98,7.36,7.74]},{"text":"Working under an aggressive four-day deadline, Wozniak labored around the clock to create an extraordinarily lean hardware layout.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t5-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.32,"voiceJa":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":8.47,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.5,0.66,1.31,1.84,2.84,3.28,3.74,4.04,4.38,4.74,5.04,5.34,5.54,6.68,7.04,7.5]},{"text":"The impressive reduction in components earned a bonus worth several thousand dollars, which Atari promptly paid directly to Jobs.","voice":"voice/reserve-apps-atari-paid-steve-jobs/t5-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","S","M","V","M","M","M"],"dur":7.24,"voiceJa":"voice/r